    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you for letting me know! I appreciate your kind offer. How did you come to be interested in the community?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:17:58.768481+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I think I am interested in the community. Just so long as it is a place that helps and protects people like me.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:18:29.196393+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I can definitely see you being an active member of the community. Have you had a chance to check it out yourself?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:20:09.102073+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm really interested in joining the community.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:20:41.995250+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that. It must be a place with events for people like me to connect and feel welcome.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:24:06.173431+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What events do people in the community participate in? I want to make sure that I can connect with others and feel welcome. Do you have any suggestions on what activities I could consider?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:25:28.017342+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm glad to hear that you are interested in the community. What events do people here participate in? Do you have any ideas for future activities or things to try out?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:30:30.279490+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I think that would be a great opportunity for me to learn more about the community and meet others who might be interested in joining as well. Do you have any suggestions on what events or activities I could participate in?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:34:52.464972+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, that sounds like a great idea. Can you give me some suggestions on what events or activities we could participate in?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:37:29.435296+00:00"
